          "en": "A quadrotor inspection platform for residential fire-access corridors, combining LiDAR-inertial localization, 3D mapping, hierarchical planning and YOLOv8n clutter detection. A Qt console coordinates area coverage, cross-floor inspection, task authorization and visual records.",
